# D48 lateral box at 298.15 K (bulk cooling density 0.833332 g/cm3): Lx 64.6896, Ly 64.6896 A; z unchanged
change_box all x final 12.9980865645 77.6876988255 y final 12.9980865645 77.6876988255 remap units box
fix md all nvt temp 298.15 298.15 1000
run 500000
unfix md
undump cool
write_data cooled.data pair ij
write_restart cooled.restart

